WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.860
A school of twelve hundred students.

2
00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.580
On day one, a rumour starts
with just twenty of them.

3
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.370
At first, dots light up slowly.

4
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.240
Then very fast.

5
00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.360
Then hardly at all, until
almost every dot is lit.

6
00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.650
Plot students who have heard against days,

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.480
and you get an S shape.

8
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.540
So why does it stall?

9
00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.060
Do people just get bored of passing it on?

10
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.860
Or does all growth slow down eventually?

11
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.060
In this mission, you'll see that early on,

12
00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:31.270
the growth looks exponential.

13
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.920
But the count can't go
past twelve hundred.

14
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.800
So you'll need a model
with a ceiling built in.

15
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.930
Your mission: explain why
rumours and crazes spread fast,

16
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:41.950
then level off.
